; 0_fm_example_a — Streets-of-Rage / Bare Knuckle style driving lead
;
; C minor groove.  Eighth-note ostinato on the root anchors the
; rhythm, then a 3rd/5th lift, then a falling answer phrase.

T220
I0
V13
O4
L8

; A — root ostinato (steady 8th-note pulse)
C C E- G  C C E- G
C C E- G  C C E- G

; B — push to fourth (drives forward)
F F A- > C  F F A- > C
< G G > D F  < G G > D F

; C — answer phrase, descending
> C < B- A- G  F E- D C
> C < B- A- G  F E- D C
; tail — short cadence
B- F G C  > C2

~
